  "sv.fu_mine_hint": { pt: "Registar e marcar quando há é grátis. Nas reservas, o cliente paga ao posto o combustível mais a taxa do APP; o posto entrega essa taxa ao Huambo Online.", en: "Registering and marking availability is free. For reservations, the customer pays the station for the fuel plus the app fee; the station passes that fee on to Huambo Online.", zh: "登记和标注有货均免费。预订时，客户向加油站支付燃油费和应用服务费；加油站再将该服务费交给 Huambo Online。", fr: "L'inscription et l'indication de disponibilité sont gratuites. Pour les réservations, le client paie à la station le carburant plus les frais de l'application ; la station reverse ces frais à Huambo Online." },
